The parser and runtime integration uses an unmodified, revision-pinned checkout
of Liftosaur:

  Liftosaur
  Copyright (c) Anton Astashov and Liftosaur contributors
  Upstream: https://github.com/astashov/liftosaur
  License: AGPL-3.0

The exact tested revision is recorded in runtime/liftosaur.version. Liftosaur
source is fetched during runtime setup and is not vendored in this repository.

ZIP creation and reading uses the fflate npm package:

  fflate
  Copyright (c) 2026 Arjun Barrett
  Upstream: https://github.com/101arrowz/fflate
  License: MIT

fflate is installed as a separate package dependency and retains its MIT
license notice in its distributed package.

The external corpus reads the public RP Hypertrophy v4.1 program from its
Liftosaur page and verifies a reviewed SHA-256. Its source is not distributed
with this repository.
